    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "subspec_details",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 630,
      "width": 820,
      "height": 60,
      "text": "Before each agent runs, LLM generates a focused role-specific brief from: full user_request + upstream contracts + completed agents list\nBACKEND_DB gets DB-focused brief  |  BACKEND_API gets endpoint-focused brief  |  FE_PAGES gets routing brief  |  FE_UI gets component brief\nKey difference from other patterns: sub-spec is decomposed per agent, not just passed through as raw contracts",
      "originalText": "Before each agent runs, LLM generates a focused role-specific brief from: full user_request + upstream contracts + completed agents list\nBACKEND_DB gets DB-focused brief  |  BACKEND_API gets endpoint-focused brief  |  FE_PAGES gets routing brief  |  FE_UI gets component brief\nKey difference from other patterns: sub-spec is decomposed per agent, not just passed through as raw contracts",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
